Car Trip
Chef rented a car for a day.Usually, the cost of the car is Rs 10 per km. However, since Chef has booked the car for the whole day, he needs to pay for at least 300  kms even if the car runs less than 300 kms.
If the car ran X  kms, determine the cost Chef needs to pay.

input
5
800
3
299
301
300

output
8000
3000
3000
3010
3000

====
t=int(input())
for i in range(t):
    x=int(input())
    if x>=300:
        print(x*10)
    elif x<300:
        print("3000")
